  "changed_since_previous": "Rebased onto recent master without substantive changes to the tracepoint interface or implementation.",
  "card": "Adds `net:block_header` and `net:compact_block_reconstructed` USDT tracepoints to Bitcoin Core to emit structured compact block reconstruction and header arrival metrics. This solves an observability limitation for telemetry tools and network researchers who currently must scrape text-based debug logs to measure mempool overlap, peer reconstruction success, and extra transaction pool utility. The tracepoints provide low-overhead, disjoint transaction source counts and peer IDs without adding overhead to the hot path when probes are disabled.",
